    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16">

      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">About Chayce Properties</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Chayce Properties</strong> is a real estate company based in the United Kingdom. Zunkiree Labs works with Chayce as an embedded technical partner rather than a single-project vendor.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">The engagement</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Most engagements start with one deliverable — a website build, an SEO project, a single integration — and end there. For Chayce Properties, Zunkiree Labs owns the full digital stack: the website itself, the AI systems built on top of it, and the ongoing technical delivery that keeps both running and improving.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">What we manage</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">Website</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">Ongoing development, maintenance, and improvements to the Chayce Properties website.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">AI systems</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">AI-powered features built into the Chayce Properties platform, designed around how the business actually operates.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">Ongoing technical delivery</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">Continuous delivery of fixes, features, and technical work — not a one-time handoff.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">Why it works</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Owning the whole stack means Zunkiree Labs doesn't have to hand off between vendors when a website change affects an AI feature, or when an AI feature needs a change on the site. One team, one point of accountability, across every system Chayce Properties runs on.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

